    "Scan of the 1941 edition of the Cruso, North Carolina, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the Tennessee Valley Authority. Aerial photographs from 1976; field checked in 1941; photo inspected in 1987; photo revised in 1979; last revised in 1979; printed in 1991.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 21.8 x 26.6 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
